            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
              <div class="stat-number">$0.86</div>
              <div class="stat-label">session cost</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
              <div class="stat-number">3</div>
              <div class="stat-label">loops detected</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Social Proof Logo Strip -->
    <div class="logo-strip-wrapper">
      <div class="logo-strip-label">Built for teams running production LLM workflows:</div>
      <div class="logo-marquee">
        <div class="logo-item">Agent Platforms</div>
        <div class="logo-item">ML Infrastructure</div>
        <div class="logo-item">Product Engineering</div>
        <div class="logo-item">Reliability Teams</div>
        <div class="logo-item">FinOps</div>
        <div class="logo-item">Developer Tooling</div>
        <div class="logo-item">Agent Platforms</div>
        <div class="logo-item">ML Infrastructure</div>
        <div class="logo-item">Product Engineering</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Problem Section -->
    <section class="problem-section" id="problem">
      <h2 class="problem-headline">Your AI agents are burning money in invisible loops</h2>
      <div class="problem-grid">
        <div class="problem-card">
          <div class="problem-stat">70%</div>
          <h3>Wasted Spend</h3>
          <p>of token spend is wasted on retries, excess context, and bad prompts</p>
        </div>
        <div class="problem-card">
          <div class="problem-stat">âˆž</div>
          <h3>No Visibility</h3>
          <p>runaway tool call loops with no automatic detection or alerts</p>
        </div>
        <div class="problem-card">
          <div class="problem-stat">$0</div>
          <h3>Missing Attribution</h3>
          <p>no visibility into which agent, user, or feature is responsible</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Feature 01: Trace -->
    <section class="feature-section" id="features">
      <div class="feature-content">
        <div class="feature-number">01</div>
        <h2>Trace every call in real time</h2>
        <p>
          Every LLM call, tool execution, and context build is captured and visualized as a time-proportional flame graph. See exactly which calls consumed the most tokens and why.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-visual">
        <div style="text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: var(--text-sm);">
          Real-time icicle chart showing token flow
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Feature 02: Detect -->
    <section class="feature-section reverse">
      <div class="feature-content">
        <div class="feature-number">02</div>
        <h2>Catch runaway loops before they blow your budget</h2>
        <p>
          Infinite loops and cascading tool calls are automatically detected and highlighted in red. You'll know instantly when a session goes haywire, with real-time alerts to your email, Slack, or webhook.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-visual">
        <div style="text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: var(--text-sm);">
          Loop detection highlighted in flame graph
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Feature 03: Attribute -->
    <section class="feature-section">
      <div class="feature-content">
        <div class="feature-number">03</div>
        <h2>Know exactly which feature is costing you the most</h2>
        <p>
          Drill down by model, agent, user, feature, or any metadata you send. Costs are attributed back to the exact line of code that triggered the expense, making optimization surgical and data-driven.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-visual">
        <div style="text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: var(--text-sm);">
          Stacked cost breakdown by model and feature
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Code Integration Section -->
    <section class="code-section">
      <h2 class="code-headline">Add 3 lines. See everything.</h2>
      <div class="code-container">
        <div class="code-header">
          <div class="code-dot red"></div>
          <div class="code-dot yellow"></div>
          <div class="code-dot green"></div>
          <div class="code-path">agent.js</div>
        </div>
        <div class="code-block">
          <code>{`import { LocalCollector } from "flamegraph-sdk";

const collector = new LocalCollector({
  serverUrl: process.env.FLAMEGRAPH_URL,
  apiKey: process.env.FLAMEGRAPH_API_KEY,
});

instrumentAgent(agent, { collector });`}</code>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button class="copy-btn">Copy code</button>
      <p class="code-tagline">Events flow to your dashboard in < 2 seconds</p>
